{"step_index":23,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-04T23:18:14Z","thinking":"**Analyzing User Request**\n\nI'm currently dissecting the user's new request. The primary focus is understanding the requirement for an interactive node click event within the context of the existing system. The core need is to trigger a pop-up explanation upon node selection, detailing the connections or relationships associated with that specific node. I'm prioritizing efficient implementation of the pop-up.\n\n\n**Designing Node Interaction**\n\nI'm now focused on the interactive details. My plan is a pop-up modal near the selected node, highlighting it and its immediate neighbors in cyan/white. Inside, I'll show the node's title, type, and connection count. I need to explain the connections, detailing the node's structural role and listing connected nodes, relationship types, and weights. Action buttons for centering, isolation, and closing the pop-up are planned.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Adds interactive node click selection with detailed pop-up explanation window. Explains structural topology, connection count, relationship rationale, neighbor list, and camera focus/subtree isolation actions.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>LUNES 3D - Visualizador Hiperbólico de Red</title>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n    body, html {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background-color: #000000;\n      color: #f1f5f9;\n      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \"SF Mono\", Menlo, Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", monospace;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      user-select: none;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    #viewport {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      display: block;\n      cursor: crosshair;\n    }\n\n    /* Premium Glass UI Overlay Panels */\n    .glass-panel {\n      background: rgba(8, 10, 16, 0.88);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\n    }\n\n    /* Top Control Bar */\n    .top-bar {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 14px;\n      left: 14px;\n      right: 14px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      z-index: 100;\n    }\n\n    .bar-group {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n    }\n\n    .brand-title {\n      padding: 8px 14px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      color: #00ffff;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .flat-btn {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\n      color: #cbd5e1;\n      padding: 7px 12px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 7px;\n      transition: all 0.15s ease;\n    }\n    .flat-btn:hover {\n      background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      border-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.4);\n      color: #ffffff;\n    }\n    .flat-btn.active {\n      background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\n      border-color: #00ffff;\n      color: #00ffff;\n    }\n\n    /* Side Drawer */\n    .side-drawer {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 66px;\n      left: 14px;\n      width: 300px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n      z-index: 90;\n      transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n    }\n    .side-drawer.collapsed {\n      opacity: 0;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      transform: translateX(-12px);\n    }\n\n    .drawer-title {\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      padding-bottom: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .cat-item {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 9px 12px;\n      margin-bottom: 7px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.15s ease;\n    }\n    .cat-item:hover {\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n    }\n\n    .cat-label-wrap {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .flat-square-icon {\n      width: 10px;\n      height: 10px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n    }\n\n    .cat-name {\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: #f8fafc;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    .cat-sub {\n      font-size: 10px;\n      color: #64748b;\n    }\n\n    .flat-badge {\n      font-size: 10px;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      padding: 2px 7px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      color: #00ffff;\n    }\n\n    .flat-toggle {\n      width: 16px;\n      height: 16px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      transition: all 0.15s;\n    }\n    .flat-toggle.checked {\n      background: #00ffff;\n      border-color: #00ffff;\n    }\n    .flat-toggle.checked::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      width: 6px;\n      height: 6px;\n      background: #000000;\n    }\n\n    /* Pop-Up Modal de Explicación de Nodo (Click Event) */\n    .node-modal {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 66px;\n      right: 14px;\n      width: 320px;\n      max-height: calc(100vh - 140px);\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      padding: 16px;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n      z-index: 150;\n      border-left: 4px solid #00ffff;\n      animation: popIn 0.2s ease-out;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes popIn {\n      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n    }\n\n    .modal-header {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      padding-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .modal-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #00ffff;\n    }\n\n    .modal-close {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    .modal-close:hover {\n      color: #ffffff;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n    }\n\n    .modal-section {\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .sec-label {\n      font-size: 10px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n      color: #64748b;\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .explanation-box {\n      background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.05);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 10px;\n      color: #cbd5e1;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n\n    .neighbor-list {\n      max-height: 140px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .neighbor-item {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 5px 8px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .neighbor-item:hover {\n      background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      color: #00ffff;\n    }\n\n    /* Bottom Status */\n    .bottom-status {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 14px;\n      left: 14px;\n      right: 14px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      z-index: 100;\n    }\n\n    .status-pill {\n      padding: 6px 14px;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.4px;\n    }\n    .status-pill b {\n      color: #00ffff;\n    }\n\n    .search-input {\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      color: #00ffff;\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      outline: none;\n      width: 160px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Top Bar -->\n  <div class=\"top-bar\">\n    <div class=\"bar-group\">\n      <div class=\"glass-panel brand-title\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"19\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M12 9L19 5M12 15L5 19\"></path></svg>\n        LUNES 3D ENGINE\n      </div>\n\n      <button class=\"glass-panel flat-btn active\" id=\"btnToggleSide\" onclick=\"toggleSideDrawer()\">\n        <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect></svg>\n        <span>Categorías & Convenciones</span>\n      </button>\n\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"searchInput\" placeholder=\"Buscar nodo...\" oninput=\"searchNode(this.value)\" class=\"glass-panel search-input\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bar-group\">\n      <button class=\"glass-panel flat-btn active\" id=\"btnAutoRot\" onclick=\"opts.autoRotate = !opts.autoRotate; this.classList.toggle('active')\">\n        <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21.5 2v6h-6M21.34 15.57a10 10 0 1 1-.57-8.38l5.67-5.67\"></path></svg>\n        Autorotación\n      </button>\n\n      <button class=\"glass-panel flat-btn\" onclick=\"resetCamera()\">\n        <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 8v8M8 12h8\"></path></svg>\n        Reset Vista\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <canvas id=\"viewport\"></canvas>\n\n  <!-- Side Drawer -->\n  <div class=\"glass-panel side-drawer\" id=\"sideDrawer\">\n    <div class=\"drawer-title\">\n      <span>Categorías & Convenciones</span>\n      <span style=\"color:#00ffff; font-size:9px;\">RE-CALCULO EN VIVO</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Cat 0 -->\n    <div class=\"cat-item\" onclick=\"toggleCat(0)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"flat-square-icon\" style=\"background:#ff0055; border-color:#ff0055;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"cat-name\">Nodo Raíz (Core Master)</div>\n          <div class=\"cat-sub\">Nivel 0 • Centro Hiperbólico</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"flat-badge\" id=\"badgeCat0\">1</span>\n        <div class=\"flat-toggle checked\" id=\"toggleCat0\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Cat 1 -->\n    <div class=\"cat-item\" onclick=\"toggleCat(1)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"flat-square-icon\" style=\"background:#00ffff; border-color:#00ffff;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"cat-name\">Hubs Principales</div>\n          <div class=\"cat-sub\">Nivel 1 • Trunks Regionales</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"flat-badge\" id=\"badgeCat1\">16</span>\n        <div class=\"flat-toggle checked\" id=\"toggleCat1\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Cat 2 -->\n    <div class=\"cat-item\" onclick=\"toggleCat(2)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"flat-square-icon\" style=\"background:#ffff00; border-color:#ffff00;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"cat-name\">Sub-Clusters (Discos Radiales)</div>\n          <div class=\"cat-sub\">Nivel 2 • Abanicos H3</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"flat-badge\" id=\"badgeCat2\">320</span>\n        <div class=\"flat-toggle checked\" id=\"toggleCat2\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Cat 3 -->\n    <div class=\"cat-item\" onclick=\"toggleCat(3)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"flat-square-icon\" style=\"background:#00ff00; border-color:#00ff00;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"cat-name\">Nodos Hoja Periféricos</div>\n          <div class=\"cat-sub\">Nivel 3 • 1 Enlace</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"flat-badge\" id=\"badgeCat3\">480</span>\n        <div class=\"flat-toggle checked\" id=\"toggleCat3\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-top:12px; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding-top:10px;\">\n      <div class=\"drawer-title\" style=\"border:none; padding:0; margin-bottom:8px;\">Opciones de Geometría</div>\n      <div class=\"cat-item\" onclick=\"opts.showSphere = !opts.showSphere; this.querySelector('.flat-toggle').classList.toggle('checked')\">\n        <span style=\"color:#cbd5e1;\">Esfera Guía (Wireframe)</span>\n        <div class=\"flat-toggle checked\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cat-item\" onclick=\"opts.showEdges = !opts.showEdges; this.querySelector('.flat-toggle').classList.toggle('checked')\">\n        <span style=\"color:#cbd5e1;\">Enlaces Crimson (Red Edges)</span>\n        <div class=\"flat-toggle checked\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cat-item\" onclick=\"opts.pulseMotion = !opts.pulseMotion; this.querySelector('.flat-toggle').classList.toggle('checked')\">\n        <span style=\"color:#cbd5e1;\">Pulsación Hiperbólica</span>\n        <div class=\"flat-toggle checked\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Pop-Up Modal al Presionar Nodo (Click Event) -->\n  <div class=\"glass-panel node-modal\" id=\"nodeModal\" style=\"display:none;\">\n    <div class=\"modal-header\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"mNodeTitle\">AS0 (Core Root)</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:10px; color:#94a3b8;\" id=\"mNodeCat\">Categoría: Raíz Central</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-close\" onclick=\"closeNodeModal()\">×</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"modal-section\">\n      <div class=\"sec-label\">¿Por qué tiene estas conexiones?</div>\n      <div class=\"explanation-box\" id=\"mExplanationText\">\n        Cargando justificación topológica...\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"modal-section\">\n      <div class=\"sec-label\" id=\"mDegreeHeader\">Conexiones Directas (16)</div>\n      <div class=\"neighbor-list\" id=\"mNeighborList\">\n        <!-- Neighbor list dynamically populated -->\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:10px;\">\n      <button class=\"flat-btn\" style=\"flex:1; justify-content:center;\" onclick=\"focusSelectedNode()\">\n        <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>\n        Centrar Vista\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"flat-btn\" style=\"flex:1; justify-content:center; background:rgba(0,255,255,0.15); border-color:#00ffff; color:#00ffff;\" onclick=\"closeNodeModal()\">\n        Entendido\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-status\">\n    <div class=\"glass-panel status-pill\">\n      Nodos Visibles: <b id=\"lblActiveNodes\">0</b> | Enlaces Activos: <b id=\"lblActiveEdges\">0</b>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"glass-panel status-pill\">\n      Presiona un nodo para ver la explicación detallada de sus relaciones\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    const opts = {\n      autoRotate: true,\n      showSphere: true,\n      showEdges: true,\n      pulseMotion: true,\n      cats: { 0: true, 1: true, 2: true, 3: true }\n    };\n\n    const palette = {\n      bg: '#000000',\n      sphere: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22)',\n      sphereEquator: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45)',\n      edge: 'rgba(160, 32, 64, 0.55)',\n      edgeActive: '#00ffff',\n      catColors: {\n        0: '#ff0055',\n        1: '#00ffff',\n        2: '#ffff00',\n        3: '#00ff00'\n      }\n    };\n\n    let nodes = [];\n    let edges = [];\n    let hoveredNode = null;\n    let selectedNode = null;\n    let searchedId = null;\n    let animTime = 0;\n\n    let rotX = 0.25, rotY = 0.55, zoom = 420;\n    let panX = 0, panY = 0;\n    let isMouseDown = false, mouseBtn = 0, lastX = 0, lastY = 0;\n    let velX = 0, velY = 0.002;\n    let clickStartX = 0, clickStartY = 0;\n\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('viewport');\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n    function resize() {\n      canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n      canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n    }\n    window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n    resize();\n\n    function buildTopology() {\n      nodes = [];\n      edges = [];\n\n      nodes.push({ id: 0, label: 'AS0 (Core Root)', x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, cat: 0, level: 0 });\n\n      const numHubs = 16;\n      const radius = 240;\n\n      for (let h = 0; h < numHubs; h++) {\n        const phi = Math.acos(1 - 2 * (h + 0.5) / numHubs);\n        const theta = Math.PI * (1 + Math.sqrt(5)) * h;\n\n        const hx = radius * Math.sin(phi) * Math.cos(theta);\n        const hy = radius * Math.sin(phi) * Math.sin(theta);\n        const hz = radius * Math.cos(phi);\n\n        const hubId = nodes.length;\n        nodes.push({ id: hubId, label: `AS-Hub-${h+1}`, x: hx, y: hy, z: hz, ox: hx, oy: hy, oz: hz, cat: 1, level: 1 });\n        edges.push({ source: 0, target: hubId });\n\n        let up = (Math.abs(hz / radius) > 0.9) ? {x:1, y:0, z:0} : {x:0, y:1, z:0};\n        const nx = hx/radius, ny = hy/radius, nz = hz/radius;\n        let ux = ny*up.z - nz*up.y, uy = nz*up.x - nx*up.z, uz = nx*up.y - ny*up.x;\n        const uLen = Math.sqrt(ux*ux + uy*uy + uz*uz) || 1;\n        ux /= uLen; uy /= uLen; uz /= uLen;\n        const vx = ny*uz - nz*uy, vy = nz*ux - nx*uz, vz = nx*uy - ny*ux;\n\n        const numSubs = 20;\n        for (let s = 0; s < numSubs; s++) {\n          const sa = (s / numSubs) * Math.PI * 2;\n          const sr = 50 + Math.random() * 20;\n          const sx = hx + sr * (Math.cos(sa) * ux + Math.sin(sa) * vx);\n          const sy = hy + sr * (Math.cos(sa) * uy + Math.sin(sa) * vy);\n          const sz = hz + sr * (Math.cos(sa) * uz + Math.sin(sa) * vz);\n\n          const subId = nodes.length;\n          nodes.push({ id: subId, label: `SubNode-${hubId}-${s}`, x: sx, y: sy, z: sz, ox: sx, oy: sy, oz: sz, cat: 2, level: 2 });\n          edges.push({ source: hubId, target: subId });\n\n          const numLeafs = 4;\n          for (let l = 0; l < numLeafs; l++) {\n            const la = sa + (l - 1.5) * 0.2;\n            const lr = sr + 22;\n            const lx = hx + lr * (Math.cos(la) * ux + Math.sin(la) * vx);\n            const ly = hy + lr * (Math.cos(la) * uy + Math.sin(la) * vy);\n            const lz = hz + lr * (Math.cos(la) * uz + Math.sin(la) * vz);\n\n            const leafId = nodes.length;\n            nodes.push({ id: leafId, label: `Leaf-${subId}-${l}`, x: lx, y: ly, z: lz, ox: lx, oy: ly, oz: lz, cat: 3, level: 3 });\n            edges.push({ source: subId, target: leafId });\n          }\n        }\n      }\n\n      recalculateDegreesAndSizes();\n    }\n\n    function recalculateDegreesAndSizes() {\n      nodes.forEach(n => {\n        n.active = opts.cats[n.cat] === true;\n        n.degree = 0;\n        n.neighbors = [];\n      });\n\n      let activeEdgesCount = 0;\n      edges.forEach(e => {\n        const s = nodes[e.source];\n        const t = nodes[e.target];\n        if (s && t && s.active && t.active) {\n          s.degree++;\n          t.degree++;\n          s.neighbors.push(t);\n          t.neighbors.push(s);\n          e.active = true;\n          activeEdgesCount++;\n        } else {\n          e.active = false;\n        }\n      });\n\n      let activeNodesCount = 0;\n      const catCounts = { 0: 0, 1: 0, 2: 0, 3: 0 };\n\n      nodes.forEach(n => {\n        if (n.active) {\n          activeNodesCount++;\n          catCounts[n.cat]++;\n          const deg = n.degree || 1;\n          const targetSz = Math.max(2, Math.round(1.5 + Math.sqrt(deg) * 1.6));\n          if (n.currentSize === undefined) n.currentSize = targetSz;\n          n.targetSize = targetSz;\n        }\n      });\n\n      document.getElementById('badgeCat0').innerText = catCounts[0];\n      document.getElementById('badgeCat1').innerText = catCounts[1];\n      document.getElementById('badgeCat2').innerText = catCounts[2];\n      document.getElementById('badgeCat3').innerText = catCounts[3];\n\n      document.getElementById('lblActiveNodes').innerText = activeNodesCount;\n      document.getElementById('lblActiveEdges').innerText = activeEdgesCount;\n    }\n\n    function toggleCat(catId) {\n      opts.cats[catId] = !opts.cats[catId];\n      const toggleEl = document.getElementById(`toggleCat${catId}`);\n      if (toggleEl) toggleEl.classList.toggle('checked', opts.cats[catId]);\n      recalculateDegreesAndSizes();\n    }\n\n    function toggleSideDrawer() {\n      document.getElementById('sideDrawer').classList.toggle('collapsed');\n      document.getElementById('btnToggleSide').classList.toggle('active');\n    }\n\n    function resetCamera() {\n      rotX = 0.25; rotY = 0.55; zoom = 420; panX = 0; panY = 0;\n    }\n\n    function searchNode(q) {\n      if (!q.trim()) { searchedId = null; return; }\n      const found = nodes.find(n => n.active && (n.label.toLowerCase().includes(q.toLowerCase()) || n.id.toString() === q));\n      searchedId = found ? found.id : null;\n    }\n\n    // --- NODE POP-UP INTERACTION (CLICK EVENT) ---\n    function openNodeModal(node) {\n      selectedNode = node;\n      const modal = document.getElementById('nodeModal');\n      const catNames = { 0: 'Nodo Raíz Central (Master Core)', 1: 'Hub Regional (Trunk AS)', 2: 'Sub-Cluster (Disco H3)', 3: 'Nodo Hoja Periférico' };\n\n      document.getElementById('mNodeTitle').innerText = node.label;\n      document.getElementById('mNodeCat').innerText = `Categoría: ${catNames[node.cat]}`;\n\n      // Explanation Rationale based on Topology Role\n      let explanation = \"\";\n      if (node.cat === 0) {\n        explanation = `<b>Justificación de Red:</b> Este nodo es la <b>Raíz Máxima Central</b> de la topología en espacio hiperbólico H3. Posee <b>${node.degree} conexiones directas</b> porque actúa como el centro de enrutamiento principal distribuyendo tráfico entre todos los Hubs Regionales de la red.`;\n      } else if (node.cat === 1) {\n        explanation = `<b>Justificación de Red:</b> Este nodo es un <b>Hub Regional de Concentración</b>. Mantiene <b>${node.degree} conexiones activas</b> (1 enlace troncal hacia la Raíz Central y ${node.degree-1} enlaces descendentes) organizados en un disco radial plano para maximizar el ancho de banda hacia sus sub-clusters.`;\n      } else if (node.cat === 2) {\n        explanation = `<b>Justificación de Red:</b> Este nodo pertenece a un <b>Sub-Cluster local</b>. Mantiene <b>${node.degree} conexiones</b> distribuyendo información entre el Hub Regional padre y sus nodos periféricos adyacentes.`;\n      } else {\n        explanation = `<b>Justificación de Red:</b> Este es un <b>Nodo Hoja Periférico (Terminal)</b>. Mantiene <b>${node.degree} conexión dedicada</b> con su Sub-Cluster padre para ejecutar operaciones de computación en el extremo (Edge computing) sin recargar la columna vertebral.`;\n      }\n      documen